{"words": [{"text": "كَمَآ", "translation": "As"}, {"text": "أَرْسَلْنَا", "translation": "We sent"}, {"text": "فِيكُمْ", "translation": "among you"}, {"text": "رَسُولًۭا", "translation": "a Messenger"}, {"text": "مِّنكُمْ", "translation": "from you"}, {"text": "يَتْلُوا۟", "translation": "(who) recites"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "translation": "to you"}, {"text": "ءَايَـٰتِنَا", "translation": "Our verses"}, {"text": "وَيُزَكِّيكُمْ", "translation": "and purifies you"}, {"text": "وَيُعَلِّمُكُمُ", "translation": "and teaches you"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ", "translation": "the Book"}, {"text": "وَٱلْحِكْمَةَ", "translation": "and the wisdom"}, {"text": "وَيُعَلِّمُكُم", "translation": "and teaches you"}, {"text": "مَّا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "لَمْ", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "تَكُونُوا۟", "translation": "you were"}, {"text": "تَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "knowing"}], "sahih": "Just as We have sent among you a messenger from yourselves reciting to you Our verses and purifying you and teaching you the Book and wisdom1 and teaching you that which you did not know."}